# This project is small (28 MB) because it borrows its terrain from SriPada
# rather than holding its own copy, so nothing bulky needs excluding.
#
# Viewsheds/ is deliberately kept. It is only 21 MB but represents roughly
# 90 minutes of compute (about 2 minutes per peak, 45 peaks), and
# 21_peak_viewsheds.py is resumable only if these survive.

